      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated long-term clinicians with administrative tensions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently celebrate Dr Murphy, Dr Duran, Dr Rech, and office lead Cassy for their compassionate approach and dedication spanning many years of clinical service. Nonetheless, a couple of clients reported hostile management encounters and absent pre-procedural guidance from front-desk staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful medical advice and billing missteps"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers appreciate thorough consultations, photo updates during pet boarding, and timely follow-up messages. Conversely, critical reviews cite uncommunicated price increases on medication refills, unclarified dental surgical estimates, and a lack of preparation instructions for sedated appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Kind care for pets and exotics"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the loving care extended to domestic dogs, nervous cats, and companion birds, with clients observing that their animals appear relaxed upon collection. Pet guardians appreciate that the veterinary team accommodates exotic species and manages chronic conditions like canine allergies and hip dysplasia."
      }
    }
  ],
